## Configuring Test Runners

### Playwright

```javascript
// playwright.config.js
use: {
  testIdAttribute: 'data-testid'
}
```

### Cypress

```javascript
// cypress.config.js
Cypress.SelectorPlayground.defaults({
  selectorPriority: ['data-testid', 'id', 'class', 'tag']
})
```

### Fullstory

Use `data-testid` as the primary search attribute:

```
Search: [data-testid="ProductCard__add-to-cart"]
```

Fullstory also supports `data-fs-element`; you can map:

```html
<button data-testid="ProductCard__add-to-cart" data-fs-element="Add to Cart">
```

